== Breaking changes ==
* [[API COMBAT_LOG_EVENT|COMBAT_LOG_EVENT]] and COMBAT_LOG_EVENT_UNFILTERED have a new third parameter, hideCaster.
* Addons are now required to register the prefixes they want to receive {{api|SendAddonMessage}} messages for using {{api| RegisterAddonMessagePrefix}}.

